{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52594","headline":"发馆陶 · 郭震","name":"发馆陶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"促辔数残更，似闻鷄一鸣。\n春风马上梦，沙路月中行。\n笳鼓远多思，衣裘寒始轻。\n稍知田父稔，灯火闻柴荆。\n（录自光绪十一年刊刘家善纂《馆陶县志》卷十一）（按：《青琐高议》、《皇朝文监》、《锦绣万花谷後集》、《舆地纪胜》另录郭震诗多首，爲宋太宗时成都隐士郭震作，不录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}